# ---------------------------------------------------------------- not distributed
# The synthetic SFT corpus. Generated with Claude, and deliberately not
# redistributed from this repository. The generation pipeline is here
# (workflows/, scripts/harvest_round.py, scripts/consolidate_instruct.py); its
# output is not.
#
# NOTE: cloud/bootstrap.sh clones this repo on the pod to find the corpus at
# data/synthetic/sprocket_sft.jsonl. To run the SFT stage you must generate it
# and commit it to your own fork first. Preflight fails with a pointer if it is
# missing, rather than 20 GPU-hours later at the SFT stage.
data/synthetic/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- never push
# Tokenized corpora: 350 MB locally, 40-200 GB after a real build. The pod
# rebuilds these from FineWeb-Edu via scripts/build_corpus.py.
data/processed/*.bin
data/processed/*.npz
data/processed/*.manifest.json
data/raw/
!data/raw/.gitkeep

# Checkpoints — 500 MB each locally, ~6 GB for the 500m with optimizer state.
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pt.tmp
*.safetensors

# Exported models (regenerate with scripts/export_hf.py)
out/
hf-*/

# Backups written by finalize_tokenizer.py / scrub_sft.py
*.bak
*.mojibake.bak

# Live dashboard state
dashboard/data/metrics*.json

# Eval output (regenerate with eval/persona_battery.py)
eval/persona_results.json

# Scratch
scratch_ckpt*/
_shards/
*.log

# Working notes, not part of the published project
NEXT_SESSION_PROMPT.md
notes/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets
# HF_TOKEN / RUNPOD_API_KEY belong in pod env vars, never in the repo.
# Anything committed here is in the git history permanently, even if deleted.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.token
secrets.json

# Python / OS
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Run logs ARE deliverables - the loss curves, throughput and corpus-build
# rates for the released model all live here. Keep them versioned.
!logs/*.log

# Downloaded model snapshots - these live on HuggingFace, not in git.
models/
